" y=\"785\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE TWO FEE OPTIONS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"835\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Actual cost — labor + supplies + postage</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"875\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">(here, essentially zero)</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"915\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Flat $6.50 — electronic to electronic only</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"965\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Document the chosen method in writing</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"995\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">$25 fits neither approach</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "TAT compliance vs fee compliance under 164.524"
